Concept 2: State

================================================================================

State is data that affects what the application displays or how it behaves.

Vanilla JS                  | React
----------------------------|------------------------------------
State managed manually      | State represented with React APIs
DOM updated manually        | Render output depends on state
Synchronization is manual   | State updates cause re-rendering
